msgstr "重複的關鍵影格在每次播放中保持相對時間。"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../clips.rst:377
msgid "**Custom Repeat** (dialog options)"
msgstr "**自訂重複** （對話框選項）"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../clips.rst:379
msgid ":guilabel:`Pattern:` Loop | Ping-Pong"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Pattern:` 迴圈 | 乒乓"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../clips.rst:380
msgid ":guilabel:`Direction:` Forward | Reverse"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Direction:` 正向 | 反向"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../clips.rst:381
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Passes:` integer (2 or more). This is the number of times it will"
" play."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Passes:` 整數（2 或以上）。這是播放次數。"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../clips.rst:382
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delay:` number + units [frames | ms | sec]. This is an optional "
"delay between each repeated pass."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Delay:` 數字 + 單位 [影格 | 毫秒 | 秒]。這是每次重複播放間的可選延遲。"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../clips.rst:383
